  "gnu_source_rationale": [
    "glibc sigwait delegates to hidden __sigtimedwait; the normal reviewed syscall/cancellation path uses stack data, TLS/atomics and rt_sigtimedwait without allocation or user-space locks.",
    "glibc 2.36 cancellation wrappers explicitly document AS safety except actual cancellation; glibc 2.41 sigfillset excludes internal cancellation signals.",
    "GCC 14.3.0 ProcessPendingSignalsImpl stores oldset in thread-global signal context; synchronous consumption of blocked resume avoids the nested resume handler overwriting that saved mask.",
    "GCC common sigwait interceptor retains BlockingCall handling and diagnostics."
  ]
}
